Subject: [PATCH] test(g15): independent acceptance challenge for
 approved-content integrity

Adds a reviewer-side challenge suite (author of this file is not the author of
the db9015e fix): same-version mutation of title/date/stage/kind, content swap
between approved events, source deletion, transport-mode change, revoked
verification/visibility, added pin without reapproval, missing or forged
content digest, digest copied from another lot, foreign principal, non-admin
write refusal, Streamlit rerender after mutation and tenant switch on the same
mounted component.

Repairs one real regression at PR HEAD: the reference-UI test added pins to a
legacy seed manifest that carries no approved_content_sha256, which the new
rule correctly rejects. It now publishes through the real Admin publisher, so
the same intent is proven on the actual approval path.

Full suite on this HEAD: 35 failed / 2148 passed vs 38 failed / 2115 passed
before, no new failure set.
